WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.120
I went to work at two in the afternoon at the [Times-]Picayune and worked for Rusty Collier, the staff artist in charge.

2
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:14.420
We had about a four-person art department there.

3
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.660
And she was wonderful.

4
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:23.000
She defended me when I missed deadlines and kept me from getting fired on several occasions.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.380
But it was a fun job because I worked with the news staff.

6
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.100
I can remember on a couple of occasions,

7
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:37.040
in order to get a mugshot of a deceased on the cover, I had to open the deceased’s eyes.

8
00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:44.180
The photographers would bring me the photograph and I would retouch the eyes open, so that it looked . . . the person looked alive.

9
00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.180
Well, you couldn’t do that these days.
